  "claimBoundary": "One production-code Redis service-boundary authoring case, one fresh attempt per setting and condition. It does not establish full-app, browser, SQS or population performance. Native reviewers can disagree or miss defects; ranges are not confidence intervals. New test authoring is separate from test-suite improvement and both remain excluded from aggregate scores. Both reviewers assessed all eight suites; four complete Minimal and Skill pairs form the panel.  Analysis limit expanded uniformly from 24 to 64 KiB after authoring began; original author prompts, strict outcomes and exact source remain unchanged. Candidate evidence does not establish live delivery; live byte and browser checks follow publication.",
